      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sales enquiries in Gmail to sheet with AI summary and reply draft\nSpots sales enquiries in your inbox, logs them with a summary and a score, saves a reply draft, and alerts you for hot ones.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
